{"availability":"available","full":"aws-samples/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc","name":"sample-collaborative-ai-dlc","description":"AI-DLC: Collaborative AI-Driven Development Lifecycle","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":94,"forks":35,"created":"2026-04-15T09:49:41Z","updated":"2026-10-08T20:42:58Z","license":"MIT-0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://aws-samples.github.io/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/","topics":[],"demo":"https://aws-samples.github.io/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.041Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.041Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.041Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.041Z","stars":94,"forks":35}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your whole team and their coding agents, building in one live workspace.","Collaborative AI-DLC is where a team of humans collaborates in real time with multiple remote coding agents, following the structured AI-DLC methodology. It is an early-preview AWS sample you deploy into your own AWS account: it runs the agents you already use — Kiro, Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex — in isolated cloud sessions and walks every intent through a governed lifecycle — requirements, human approval gates, parallel implementation, pull request, and a traceability graph the whole team can read.","AI-DLC is the AI-Driven Development Life Cycle methodology: phases, stages, artifacts, agent personas, and human validation gates. Collaborative AI-DLC is this platform: a shared orchestration and governance layer over those existing coding agents, not another coding assistant."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2acf6fd8c2e496e261b75b1f2421f9257fbb111cf9701bc10f53a65116759dd9","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.229Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.229Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"what